\ B-Sound Shim 16 — shimCyberLead (ch04-shims.tex Def. 17)
\ Book defaults: Saw f0 + Sq 1.004*f0 -> LP 3800 -> 1600 Hz (Q=4.0) -> C_25
3800.0 CONSTANT CYBER-LP-HI
1600.0 CONSTANT CYBER-LP-LO
4.0    CONSTANT CYBER-Q
25.0   CONSTANT CYBER-SAT-K
: SHIM-CYBER-LEAD ( y voice -- )
  >R CYBER-SAT-K R> PRIM-SAT ;
